{"sourceUrl":"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/rencaipeiyang/yanjiusheng/zhaosheng/2026/0609/332894.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:32.230450+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/rencaipeiyang/yanjiusheng/zhaosheng/2026/0609/332894.html","html":"<div>\n<h3>兰州大学公共卫生学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知</h3>\n<div>发布时间：2026-06-09   字体大小<span title=\"\">T</span>|<span title=\"\">T</span> </div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    为促进</span></span></span><span><span><span>全国优秀大学生对兰州大学公共卫生学院相关研究领域的了解，</span></span></span><span><span><span>吸纳和培养优秀科研人才，学院举办</span><span>“兰州大学公共卫生学院202</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span><span>”活动，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    一、活动时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>—7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日（具体时间安排另行通知）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    二、活动内容</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span>    1.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>开营典礼</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>：学院举行集中开营仪式，营员列席参加全球健康治理国际合作论坛。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span>    2.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>讲座与交流</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span>学院与学科介绍、专家讲座、参观活动、师生座谈会等。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span>    3</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>文化活动</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>：参观学院和校园，感受学术氛围。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    三</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>活动</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>名额</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>20人</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    四、申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    1.</span></span><span><span><span>具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体、</span></span></span><span><span><span>美、劳</span></span></span><span><span><span>全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    2.</span></span><span><span><span>有较强专业理论基础和良好科研能力的高水平大学</span></span></span><span><span><span>或优势特色学科的</span></span></span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>届毕业生；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    3.</span></span><span><span><span>在校前</span><span>5或7学期学业成绩排名在专业或班级前30%（所有专业课成绩及格）；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    4.</span></span><span><span><span>英语水平良好；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    5.</span></span><span><span><span>无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    五、申请流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span>    1.</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><span>材料</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    （</span><span>1）兰州大学公共卫生学院202</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（附件</span><span>1）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    （</span><span>2）本科前5或7个学期成绩单（由教务部门盖章），排名专业或班级前30％的证明（由教务部门或院系盖章）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    （</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    （</span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>）英语四、六级证书复印件</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    （</span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>）其他证明材料（如获奖证书、学术论文，非必须）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    （</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>）报名信息登记表</span><span>1份（附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>    2.报名方式</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    请将</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>以上材料按照顺序打包成一个文件夹（材料</span><span>⑴</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-(5)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF扫描版，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>(6)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>Excel电子版），发送至邮箱</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>ggwsxy</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>@lzu.edu.cn（邮件主题：夏令营-本科学校-姓名）。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名时间</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>截止</span><span>2026年6月25日，过期不再接收申请。   </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    六、资格审查与营员选拔</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    1.</span></span><span><span><span>学院将审核申请者提供的各项材料，择优确定夏令营参营名单并在学院网站（</span></span></span><span><span>https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/</span></span><span><span><span>）上公布。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    申请人务必保证提交的各项材料真实准确，如有不实情况，一经发现将直接取消参营资格，并保留追诉的权利。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    七、其他</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    1.</span></span><span><span><span>兰州大学将为营员报销夏令营期间的住宿（</span></span></span><span><span><span>兰州市内</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生不提供住宿）、团体意外保险（保险期为报到后至闭营）</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>从学校往返兰州的普通火车硬座票</span><span>/高铁二等座（12小时以上可以乘坐卧铺）/汽车票。请自行提前预订往返车票和住宿，主办方不提供订票服务。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    2.</span></span><span><span><span>营员务必保障自己的人身安全；学员在营期间，必须遵守暑期学校的规章制度。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>    3.</span></span><span><span><span>本通知未尽事宜，由兰州大学公共卫生学院负责解释。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>    八、联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    联系部门：兰州大学公共卫生学院办公室</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    联系电话：</span><span>0931-8915008</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    联</span> <span>系</span> <span>人：孙老师</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    邮</span>    <span>箱：</span><span>ggwsxy@lzu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    地</span>    <span>址：甘肃省兰州市城关区东岗西路</span><span>199号</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>    附件</span><span>:</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>        1.<a href=\"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/sph/upload/files/20260609/0a4d1c61ba0b4a9cbb7bfc193b341e87.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">兰州大学公共卫生学院</a></span><a href=\"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/sph/upload/files/20260609/0a4d1c61ba0b4a9cbb7bfc193b341e87.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>202</span></a></span></span><a href=\"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/sph/upload/files/20260609/0a4d1c61ba0b4a9cbb7bfc193b341e87.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>        2.<a href=\"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/sph/upload/files/20260609/685848d2d6574cf38368a5f6204ba694.xls\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">报名信息登记表</a></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>公共卫生学院</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2026年6月9日</span></span></span></p>\n<p>  </p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<strong>上一篇：</strong><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/X5grwbka2L_3CxvfRy1OMQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">兰州大学2027年接收推免生（直博生）预报名系统已开通！</a><br/>\n<strong>下一篇：</strong><a href=\"https://sph.lzu.edu.cn/rencaipeiyang/yanjiusheng/zhaosheng/2026/0322/329146.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">公共卫生学院2026年硕士研究生复试录取实施细则</a>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"f3b6756444422643a847a07c4bd98b9fce31130aca6d690798b573da097595fd","textLength":1251,"sourceSha256":"7b033b1b4c55d280a5ea2a9d3b7a52c01f418264da126608713474069f13ac83","selector":"article-like:article","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-96ce7a199c7fa613bf31","title":"2026年兰州大学公共卫生学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:32.230450+00:00"}
